    "description": "<p>The most adaptable war machine, ruling ground combat since the War in Heaven; each Sphere has its own storied models.</p><p>Weapon packages (pick one; SD and AP vary with it): an AC/20 loaded with HV Ammo plus a Miniaturized Multilas; an Inferno Cannon plus a Miniaturized Blazer; a PPC and 2 extra AP; a Railgun, an Advanced Sensor System and 2 extra AP; a HAG, an Advanced Sensor System and 2 extra AP; a Vulcan Mega-Bolter and 2 extra AP; an LRM firing Inferno missiles and 1 extra AP; an SRM firing Inferno missiles and one Cargo Space; a Vehicle CQC Weapon of any category with four Improve Str +1, Speed +5 and Maneuver +1.</p>",
    "source": {
      "book": "DtD 7.7a",
      "page": 383
    }
